  Description: "Turns a flat photo into a 3D spatial image on Specs with the Snap Spatial Image API (through Remote Service Gateway): a ready-made gallery that uploads each image, swaps the flat placeholder for the returned depth mesh, eases the depth in and flattens it at steep viewing angles."
